# Corpus, embeddings, and indexes are derived artifacts — rebuilt via
# `meditations ingest` / `meditations index`. Never commit them.
# (data/* rather than data/ so the .gitkeep re-include below can work —
# git never descends into a fully excluded directory.)
data/*
!data/.gitkeep

# Python
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
.pytest_cache/

# Secrets (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY / VOYAGE_API_KEY live in the environment or here)
.env

# Golden-set curation worksheet: a scratch tool for generating the queries.
# Its durable content (failure modes, dead cells) lives in eval/README.md.
eval/golden_set_grid.md

# Pooling worksheets: regenerable from pool.py, and their judgements land in
# golden_set.jsonl. candidates.md IS tracked — it is the evidence behind the
# labels, and the index that produced it is not in the repo.
eval/pool/side-by-side.md
eval/pool/candidates-new.md
